#X text 20 2280 ⛔ THE WARN IS ARMED AND THE RECOVERY IS NOT \, which is the same split the Launchpad's ownership drop already makes and it is here for a sharper reason. A device that has NEVER answered since load is ABSENT \, not lost -- and absent is the normal state of every device on a Mac. Without this gate main-dev.pd raises a device-lost warning for every pollable layer a few seconds into every session \, the dev panel shows three alerts that mean nothing \, and four headless gates that assert on err go red for a reason that has nothing to do with what they test. ⛔ IT GATES THE REPORT ONLY. lost still goes out on presence \, because that is what drives the bounded re-wire \, and a never-present device must still be recovered -- that is the whole of item 235. Nothing is silenced: an absent device is still reported \, by u_present's give-up \, which is unconditional., f 84;
